### Shopping Cart Endpoints Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json
@token = <paste-customer-token-here>

###
### VIEW CART (Auto-creates if empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### @name getCart
# Save cart ID for later use
@cart_id = 

###
### ADD ITEM TO CART
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###
### ADD ANOTHER ITEM TO CART
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_id": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

###
### VIEW CART AFTER ADDING ITEMS
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### @name getCartWithItems
# Save cart item ID for update/delete operations
@cart_item_id = 1

###
### UPDATE ITEM QUANTITY IN CART
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

###
### UPDATE ITEM QUANTITY TO 0 (Auto-deletes item)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 0
}

###
### DELETE SPECIFIC CART ITEM
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### VIEW CART AFTER DELETIONS
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### CLEAR ENTIRE CART
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### VIEW EMPTY CART
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ERROR TEST: ADD MORE ITEMS THAN AVAILABLE STOCK
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 9999
}

###
### ERROR TEST: UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS (No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart

###
### ERROR TEST: INVALID PRODUCT ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_id": 99999,
  "quantity": 1
}